A NOTE ON FORKING
-----------------

GitHub's Terms of Service give every GitHub user the right to view and
fork any public repository. Nothing here overrides that, and nothing here
attempts to.

What this licence governs is what may be done with the material once it
has been forked or copied: not sold, not redistributed, not passed off as
someone else's work, not used commercially.


WHAT THIS DOES NOT COVER
------------------------

Third-party material that is not mine to license to anyone else. Nothing
above grants you rights over it, and nothing above takes any rights away
from its authors.

  - Supabase JS client, loaded at runtime from a CDN and never bundled
    here. MIT Licence, Supabase Inc.
  - Poppins (Indian Type Foundry, Jonny Pinhorn) and Lato (Lukasz
    Dziedzic), loaded from Google Fonts. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
    Poppins outlines are also embedded in icon.svg, which the OFL permits.

No other third-party code is included. There is no build step, no package
manager and no vendored libraries.


